        "original_id": "a4a8defa-5faa-524f-ba5f-0cc3cb475f94",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garrett Morris, Jamie Foxx, Garcelle Beauvais, Christopher B. Duncan, Ellia English, Judyann Elder, Tisha Campbell\n- Products: Saturday Night Live, Martin, The Jamie Foxx Show\n- Roles: Stan Winters, Nadine Waters, Gina\n- Companies: Fox, FOX\n\nFacts:\n- Garrett Morris was born on February 1, 1937, and he is an American comedian and actor.\n- Garrett Morris was part of the original cast of Saturday Night Live and appeared on the sketch comedy program from 1975 to 1980.\n- Martin is an American sitcom that aired on Fox for five seasons from August 27, 1992 to May 1, 1997.\n- Garrett Morris played Stan Winters on the sitcom Martin from 1992 to 1995.\n- The Jamie Foxx Show starred Jamie Foxx, Garcelle Beauvais, Christopher B. Duncan, Ellia English, and Garrett Morris.\n- Judyann Elder is known for playing Nadine Waters, the mother of Gina, who was portrayed by Tisha Campbell, on the FOX sitcom Martin.",
